{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233660.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233660","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233660","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423366001:0":{"text":"마스터, 오로나가 편지를 보내왔어요. 첫 수업에 저희를 초대한대요!","source_cn":"主人，欧罗娜写信邀请了我们去听她的第一堂课！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x086EB887F4A4DBAD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 오로나가 편지를 보내왔어요. 첫 수업에 저희를 초대한대요!","female":"마스터, 오로나가 편지를 보내왔어요. 첫 수업에 저희를 초대한대요!","variant_male_record_index":"170140","variant_female_record_index":"170141","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423366002:0":{"text":"시간도 맞으니까 얼른 가봐요!","source_cn":"时间差不多啦，我们出发去看看吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD7BEDEE7D175E9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233670.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233670","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233670","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423367001:0":{"text":"어디 보자... 책은 이 정도면 충분할까?","source_cn":"数一数，这些书本够吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E4D6F5F541AA382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423367002:0":{"text":"책이 정말 많아요!","source_cn":"好多好多书啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB42944AB85636C53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:詹米":{"text":"제이미","source":"詹米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233680.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233680","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233680","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423368001:0":{"text":"오로나와 제이미가 수업 준비를 하고 있는 모양이에요!","source_cn":"欧罗娜和詹米好像正在为开课做准备呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96529E306621ECFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423368002:0":{"text":"아이들이 많이 와 있네요. 오로나, 정말 즐겁겠어요!","source_cn":"已经来了不少孩子，真为欧罗娜感到开心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCBB2AED57365FD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233690.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233690","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233690","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423369001:1":{"text":"오셨군요! 제 첫 수업에 와주셔서 정말 고맙습니다.","source_cn":"你们来了！谢谢你们愿意来听我的第一课。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58CAC6AFC66FB8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423369002:1":{"text":"오로나, 아이들이 많이 보였네요. 벌써 사랑 받는 선생님이 된 것 같아요!","source_cn":"欧罗娜，我们看到许多孩子也已经来了，看来你很受孩子们欢迎嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF872CEB028BA9B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423369003:1":{"text":"사리에 님께서 제 이야기를 들어주신 덕분이에요. 처음에 여기서 수업을 하겠다고 하니까, 어른도 아이들도 전부 믿지 않았거든요...","source_cn":"这要多谢你们在沙利叶大人面前提起这件事。一开始我跟这里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0332F1196C81763F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423369004:1":{"text":"그런데 사리에 님께서 책과 종이, 필기도구까지 잔뜩 보내주시고 학교까지 지어주겠다고 하시니까 다들 믿어줬어요.","source_cn":"后来，沙利叶大人给我送来了许多书本纸笔，还说要在这里建...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x572BF2BBA39DEECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1423369004":{"text":"그런데 사리에 님께서 책과 종이, 필기도구까지 잔뜩 보내주시고 학교까지 지어주겠다고 하시니까 다들 믿어줬어요.","source_cn":"后来，沙利叶大人给我送来了许多书本纸笔，还说要在这里建一所学校，大家才对我有了信心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x572BF2BBA39DEECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423369005:1":{"text":"전부 오로나가 있어서 할 수 있던 일이에요!","source_cn":"有了你才有了这一切的开始！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12E5F82680821D09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423369006:1":{"text":"오로나 누나, 이제 수업 시작해요?","source_cn":"欧罗娜姐姐，是不是可以开始上课了呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAC5FBAC340ECEB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423369007:1":{"text":"시간이 다 됐네요... 어디 보자, 아이들이 다 왔는지 세어볼게요. 하나, 둘, 셋...","source_cn":"到时间了啊……我数数孩子们有没有到齐，一，二，三……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA249932C428E2CA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423369008:1":{"text":"어라? 한 명이 모자라요.","source_cn":"哎……？好像少了一个孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC557A89C58324DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423369009:1":{"text":"오로나 누나. 시나요! 시나가 안 왔어요!","source_cn":"欧罗娜姐姐，是希娜！希娜没有来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE76C379692903A69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423369010:1":{"text":"어떡하죠? 아이들이 다 기다리고 있는데... 수업을 시작해야 할까요?","source_cn":"要怎么办？孩子们都在等着……要现在开始上课吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478B23285A40C9D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423369011:1":{"text":"한 명이라도 빠지면 완벽한 수업이 될 수 없어요. 이렇게 서둘러서 시작하면 안 돼요.","source_cn":"哪怕少了一个孩子，我的课堂都是不完整的，不应该这样草率...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C03526354596A3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423369012:1":{"text":"제이미, 시나가 있을 만한 곳을 알고 있나요?","source_cn":"詹米，你知道希娜现在可能在哪里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA51D6CACDF7042F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423369013:1":{"text":"몰라요. 요즘 시나랑은 안 놀아서... 하지만 시나는 주르랑 놀았으니까, 주르는 알 거예요.","source_cn":"我不知道，希娜最近没有跟我玩……但希娜跟朱尔玩了，朱尔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB77AFCF5DF2C0A29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423369014:1":{"text":"주르를 찾아가서 물어봐요!","source_cn":"我们去找朱尔问问吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ADD34CB1BDB8BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"네 선택 덕분이야","source_cn":"这要感谢你的选择","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD9885296F23468","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네 선택 덕분이야","female":"네 선택 덕분이야","variant_male_record_index":"73944","variant_female_record_index":"73945","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:詹米":{"text":"제이미","source":"詹米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233700.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233700","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233700","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423370001:1":{"text":"선생님, 수업 시간 아니에요? 왜 시작 안 해요?","source_cn":"老师，是不是到上课的时间了，怎么还不开始上课呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6E9586C5EFB17E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423370002:1":{"text":"주르, 시나가 어디 갔는지 아나요? 아직 수업에 오지 않아서... 혼자만 빼놓고 시작할 수는 없잖아요?","source_cn":"朱尔，你知道希娜去哪了吗？她没有来上课……我们不能丢下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA69083CB0BB76AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423370003:1":{"text":"선생님, 시나요... 안 온다고 했어요. 진짜 기다려야 해요?","source_cn":"老师，希娜跟我说过……她不会来了。我们真的要等她吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DE1F4DB020D7C96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423370004:1":{"text":"혹시 선생님에게 시나가 무슨 말을 했는지 조금 더 들려줄 수 있나요?","source_cn":"可以跟老师讲讲，她还跟你说了些什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A7C1F7F04E68164","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423370005:1":{"text":"\"오로나 선생님은 곧 왕성으로 돌아갈 거야. 지금은 그냥 재미있어서 그러는 거지, 시시해지면 곧 우리를 버릴 거야\"... 이런 말을 했어요. 저희가 조금이라도 반박하면 금세 뛰쳐나갔고요.","source_cn":"她一直跟我们说“欧罗娜很快就会回王城的”“她只是一时兴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA2674F984612A71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423370006:1":{"text":"시나도 혹시 저희가 자길 버렸다고 생각하는 걸까요... 하지만 걘 수업에 안 온다고 했는데...","source_cn":"希娜会不会觉得我们抛弃了她……可是，她又不愿意来上课……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B89ABEBCBBC38D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1423370006":{"text":"시나도 혹시 저희가 자길 버렸다고 생각하는 걸까요... 하지만 걘 수업에 안 온다고 했는데...","source_cn":"希娜会不会觉得我们抛弃了她……可是，她又不愿意来上课……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B89ABEBCBBC38D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423370007:1":{"text":"남쪽으로 갔어요. 아마 사냥하러 갔을 거예요. 기분이 나빠지면 항상 사냥하러 갔거든요.","source_cn":"她往南边去了，我猜应该是去打猎了吧。她一不开心，就会去打猎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EF62DDB1070BCFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423370008:1":{"text":"고마워요, 주르. 여기서 기다리면 선생님이 금방 시나를 데려올게요!","source_cn":"谢谢你，朱尔，你先在这里等着，老师会把希娜找到带回来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8334DAC2410EFF06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"시나가 간 방향 기억해?","source_cn":"你还记得希娜离开的方向吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F2621DB9F8AE41","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"시나가 간 방향 기억해?","female":"시나가 간 방향 기억해?","variant_male_record_index":"73946","variant_female_record_index":"73947","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:朱尔":{"text":"주르","source":"朱尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233710.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233710","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233710","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423371001:0":{"text":"시나가 떠난 방향으로 찾으러 가봐요.","source_cn":"我们沿着希娜离开的方向找找吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B6FC0134ECD0BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233720.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233720","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233720","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423372001:0":{"text":"시나가 보였어요! 팬텀 포자 버섯에게 공격받고 있는 것 같아요!","source_cn":"看到希娜了！她在被幻灵孢菇攻击！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE7C7FD42935F01C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233740.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233740","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233740","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423374001:1":{"text":"오로나, 수업하러 갈 시간 아니야? 여긴 왜...","source_cn":"欧罗娜，你不是在给他们上课吗？为什么会在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE961DA25BED25101","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423374002:1":{"text":"설마 벌써 포기한 거야? 주르랑 제이미가 실망할 거라고! 흥, 걔들이 속고 있는 거라고 내가 그랬는데...","source_cn":"难道你这么快就放弃了？朱尔和詹米他们会很失望的！哼，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F605BF52C4559AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423374003:1":{"text":"시나를 찾아서 같이 수업을 하려고 왔어요. 저희 반에는 제이미와 주르, 레이니가 있고... 시나도 꼭 있어야 해요!","source_cn":"希娜，我是专程来找你，邀请你加入我的课堂的。我的课堂上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A656769019885EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423374004:1":{"text":"수업 안 들을 거야! 난 혼자 지내는 게 편하다고! 혼자서도 충분히 잘 살 수 있어!","source_cn":"我不需要跟你上课，我一个人自由自在习惯了！我一个人也能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA87B3BEAB4D460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423374005:1":{"text":"시나의 선택은 존중하지만, 저는... 여러분이 신기해서 계속 찾아온 게 아니라는 말을 하고 싶었어요.","source_cn":"我尊重你的选择，我只是想对你说，我不是出于新鲜感才留在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD1D82708C5FF37E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423374006:1":{"text":"저는 선생님이 되고 싶어서 이곳을 찾아온 거예요. 그건 제가 정말 하고 싶은 일이니까, 절대 중간에 포기하지 않겠어요.","source_cn":"我留在这里只有一个原因，就是想成为一名老师，因为这是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3A2188DB23B10A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423374007:1":{"text":"시나는 하고 싶은 일이 있나요? 없다면 지금 그걸 찾는 중이겠죠? 저는 시나가 하고 싶은 일을 찾을 수 있도록 도와주고 싶어요.","source_cn":"你有自己想做的事吗？如果没有的话，你现在也在寻找它的路...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85CCBC1916738121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423374008:1":{"text":"버려질까 봐... 무서운 거죠? 저에게 믿음을 주었다가 제가 떠날까 봐 무서우니까 시작조차 하고 싶지 않은 거잖아요.","source_cn":"我知道，你……害怕被抛弃，你害怕把信任交给我不久后我却...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A28AB71A9F8FF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423374009:1":{"text":"그러니까 시나에게, 그리고 저 자신에게 약속할게요. 전 쉽게 포기하지 않을 거예요. 시나가 재능을 찾고, 하고 싶은 일을 할 수 있는 사람이 될 수 있도록 도와줄게요.","source_cn":"所以我觉得，我必须向你，也是向我自己作出承诺：我不会轻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CB9F7767BED644D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423374010:1":{"text":"시나, 절 믿어 줄래요?","source_cn":"希娜，你愿意相信我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86347B760EE88C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423374011:1":{"text":"난... 빨리 어른이 되어서 엄마를 찾으러 왕성으로 가고 싶어...","source_cn":"我……其实，我想快点长大，去王城，找我的妈妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D3EE9130E64F01D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423374012:1":{"text":"저를 믿고 싶다면 제 손 위에 손을 얹어 주세요.","source_cn":"如果你愿意相信我，就把你的手搭在我的手上吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD41069815D15A49E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423374013:1":{"text":"와, 시나가 손을 얹었어요!","source_cn":"哇，希娜把手搭上去啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20D8BAB60BBB0F15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423374014:1":{"text":"눈으로 봤으면 됐지, 굳이 그걸 말까지 해야 해?","source_cn":"你们看到就好，干嘛还要说出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x200DF0B41D5B4720","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1423374015:1":{"text":"주르와 제이미가 분명 기다리고 있겠지. 얼른 돌아가자! 오로나도... 수업을 해야 하잖아.","source_cn":"朱尔和詹米他们估计都等着急了，我们赶快回去吧。你还要给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28087E7E29ECF26A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:希娜":{"text":"시나","source":"希娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14233750.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233750","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233750","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423375001:1":{"text":"우와, 선생님이 시나를 데리고 왔어. 정말 대단해!","source_cn":"唔哇，老师竟然把希娜带回来了，老师真厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x985987BFAEFF51D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423375002:1":{"text":"시나, 수업 안 듣는다고 했잖아. 왜 왔어?","source_cn":"希娜，你不是说不来上课嘛，怎么现在又过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x654F71D5A1E219B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423375003:1":{"text":"주르, 조용히 해! 그렇게 시끄럽게 안 굴어도 너 말할 줄 아는 거 알아!","source_cn":"朱尔，你少说几句没人拿你当哑巴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DC8F016200C7169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docume